# A Craftsman's Work (sandoria 94): the level guard. A DRG 39 (below AF1_QUEST_LEVEL 40): 11 (the job guard is #war).
# AF1_QUEST_LEVEL 39 (a GM's setting): 73, option 1: begun at once (aCraftsmanWork 1). AF1_QUEST_LEVEL 40 again: the
# accepted arms read no level: 69; the stone (GM): 70, its finish: the Peregrine, completed.
char zone=NorthernSanDoria pos=-167.6,4,158.7 job=DRG lvl=39
login
trigger Miaux                             # DRG 39: no arm: 11
finish
setting AF1_QUEST_LEVEL 39                # a GM's setting
trigger Miaux                             # DRG 39 at AF1_QUEST_LEVEL 39, available, has_seen 0: 73
finish option=1                           # begun at once; has_seen 0; aCraftsmanWork 1
setting AF1_QUEST_LEVEL 40
trigger Miaux                             # accepted, no stone (level 39 below 40: no level read): 69
finish
keyitem AltepaPolishingStone              # GM: the Eastern Altepa qm's
trigger Miaux                             # accepted with the stone: 70
finish                                    # the Peregrine; aCraftsmanWork 0; the stone taken; fame 20; completed
